      "en": "Without realizing it, my desire set me with my royal people’s chariots. Friends",
      "ko": "부지중에 내 마음이 나로 내 귀한 백성의 수레 가운데 이르게 하였구나",
      "source_text_hash": "1c5722126baf6a5b8832dab49f13ac665a605418b138eb532c825cb8ed9f36f7",
      "translation_text_hash": "6f76ed949ad68483ad7502d244488c2ec16206505e3ec09f1b5adc84bc84c793",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
